# Optional. The enquiry form posts to the Formspree form committed in
# src/components/Contact.tsx, which emails each enquiry on to the inbox set in
# that form's Formspree dashboard (Form → Settings → Target email). Set this
# only to point at a different form, e.g. a test one: copy this file to `.env`
# (git-ignored) and uncomment the line below.
#
# The destination address lives in Formspree, not here, so it never ships in
# the bundle where it would be scraped.
# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID
